    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>General Feat (Prerequisite: Level 4+)</em></p><p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Choose one ability in which you lack saving throw proficiency. Increase that ability score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Saving Throw Proficiency.</strong> You gain saving throw proficiency with the chosen ability.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-Qlr6tqCv0COHS5xy\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Choose the same ability for the increase and for the saving throw proficiency.</p></section>",
